One of my least favorite parts

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.780
about living in the internet age

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:40.590
is how tracked I am and
how tracked we all are.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.210
I spend a lot of time on the internet,

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.340
and when I do that,

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.430
all of my data, all of
my browsing behavior,

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.820
my purchase history, my address,

