00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:25.560
It's like not cool.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.540
Luckily, we all have rights

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.310
to get ourselves off of these lists.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.410
The problem is no one's
gonna spend the time

