00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:00.833
Anyway.

00:28:03.870 --> 00:28:06.543
I've wanted to look into
Somali pirates forever.

00:28:07.620 --> 00:28:09.510
I always saw the news over the years

00:28:09.510 --> 00:28:12.750
and never really understood
the story, the background.

00:28:12.750 --> 00:28:14.880
And we reported on this,

00:28:14.880 --> 00:28:16.200
and we talked to a lot of experts,

00:28:16.200 --> 00:28:19.230
and there's actually a
lot of politics in this.

00:28:19.230 --> 00:28:21.510
There's a lot of people

00:28:21.510 --> 00:28:26.510
who argue for like a vindication
morally of Somali pirates,

00:28:27.240 --> 00:28:29.550
saying that they're just retaliating

00:28:29.550 --> 00:28:32.040
against a world who's exploited them.

00:28:32.040 --> 00:28:34.623
And like there's a strong argument there.

00:28:35.820 --> 00:28:36.990
But I don't know.

00:28:36.990 --> 00:28:39.240
Again, I'm really curious to hear

00:28:39.240 --> 00:28:41.010
what people have to say about it.

00:28:41.010 --> 00:28:42.750
Yeah, we are interested in

00:28:42.750 --> 00:28:46.500
