00:28:46.500 --> 00:28:50.100
A video like this takes
much more time and resources

00:28:50.100 --> 00:28:51.600
to like really understand,

00:28:51.600 --> 00:28:52.500
to get the data.

00:28:52.500 --> 00:28:55.530
Like we've got this whole
dataset that we used

00:28:55.530 --> 00:28:57.270
to map every incident.

00:28:57.270 --> 00:28:59.463
Like that's just like a way bigger thing.

00:29:00.630 --> 00:29:01.800
But we want to do more of these.

00:29:01.800 --> 00:29:03.460
